@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@outfitId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000010
@planId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000040

### 新增计划，替换真实搭配 ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/planner
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outfit_id": "{{outfitId}}",
  "planned_on": "2026-11-23",
  "occasion": "commute",
  "notes": "周一通勤备选"
}

### 查看日期区间内的计划
GET {{baseUrl}}/planner?start_date=2026-11-19&end_date=2026-11-30

### 查看计划
GET {{baseUrl}}/planner/{{planId}}

### 完整修改日期和备注
PUT {{baseUrl}}/planner/{{planId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "outfit_id": "{{outfitId}}",
  "planned_on": "2026-11-24",
  "occasion": "commute",
  "notes": "改到周二"
}

### 删除计划
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/planner/{{planId}}
